---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const sections = [
  {
    title: 'Getting Started',
    links: [
      { label: 'Introduction', href: '#introduction' },
      { label: 'Vanilla JS Setup', href: '#vanilla' },
      { label: 'React Setup', href: '#react' },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: 'Guides',
    links: [
      { label: 'How It Works', href: '#how-it-works' },
      { label: 'Server Verification', href: '#server-verification' },
      { label: 'Convex Integration', href: '#convex' },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: 'Reference',
    links: [
      { label: 'API Reference', href: '#api-reference' },
      { label: 'Endpoints', href: '/#endpoints' },
    ],
  },
];
---

<Layout title="Docs — AVS AUTH">
  <Header />
  <main class="docs-page container">
    <div class="docs-header">
      <span class="section-label">DOCUMENTATION</span>
      <h1 class="docs-title">AVS AUTH Docs</h1>
      <p class="docs-subtitle">
        Everything you need to integrate privacy-first authentication into your app.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="docs-grid">
      <nav class="docs-sidebar">
        {sections.map((section) => (
          <div class="sidebar-section">
            <h3 class="sidebar-heading">{section.title}</h3>
            <ul class="sidebar-list">
              {section.links.map((link) => (
                <li>
                  <a href={link.href} class="sidebar-link">{link.label}</a>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))}
      </nav>

      <div class="docs-content">
        <!-- Introduction -->
        <section class="doc-section" id="introduction">
          <h2 class="doc-heading">Introduction</h2>
          <p>
            AVS AUTH is a privacy-first authentication broker running at
            <code>auth.adityavs.tech</code>. It provides instant auth for any web app
            with zero dashboard setup. Your domain is your client ID.
          </p>
          <p>
            Every user gets a <strong>pairwise subject ID</strong> unique to your app's origin.
            Apps cannot correlate users across different origins. The protocol is standard
            OpenID Connect with PKCE S256.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Vanilla JS -->
        <section class="doc-section" id="vanilla">
          <h2 class="doc-heading">Vanilla JS Setup</h2>
          <h3 class="doc-subheading">Option 1: Hosted Script (easiest)</h3>
          <pre class="doc-code"><code>&lt;script src="https://auth.adityavs.tech/avs-auth.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</code></pre>

          <h3 class="doc-subheading">Option 2: NPM Package</h3>
          <pre class="doc-code"><code>npm install @avs-auth/auth</code></pre>
          <pre class="doc-code"><code>import {"{"} createAvsAuth {"}"} from "@avs-auth/auth"

const auth = createAvsAuth({"{"}<br/>  avsBaseUrl: "https://auth.adityavs.tech",<br/>  callbackPath: "/auth/callback"<br/>{"}"})

// Start sign-in flow
await auth.startSignIn()

// Handle callback (on your callback page)
await auth.handleCallback()

// Get identity
const identity = auth.getIdentity()
console.log(identity.userId)  // pairwise subject ID</code></pre>
        </section>

        <!-- React -->
        <section class="doc-section" id="react">
          <h2 class="doc-heading">React Setup</h2>
          <pre class="doc-code"><code>npm install @avs-auth/react</code></pre>
          <pre class="doc-code"><code>import {"{"} useAvsAuth {"}"} from "@avs-auth/react"

function App() {"{"}<br/>  const auth = useAvsAuth({"{"}<br/>    avsBaseUrl: "https://auth.adityavs.tech",<br/>    callbackPath: "/auth/callback"<br/>  {"}"})<br/><br/>  return (<br/>    &lt;div&gt;<br/>      &lt;button onClick={"{"}() =&gt; void auth.signIn(){"}"}&gt;Sign In&lt;/button&gt;<br/>      &lt;p&gt;{"{"}auth.identity.userId ?? "Signed out"{"}"}&lt;/p&gt;<br/>      &lt;p&gt;Session: {"{"}auth.sessionState{"}"}&lt;/p&gt;<br/>    &lt;/div&gt;<br/>  )<br/>{"}"}</code></pre>
        </section>

        <!-- How It Works -->
        <section class="doc-section" id="how-it-works">
          <h2 class="doc-heading">How It Works</h2>
          <ol class="doc-list">
            <li>Your app redirects to <code>/authorize</code> with a PKCE challenge</li>
            <li>User signs in via Google at the broker (if no session exists)</li>
            <li>User approves your app (consent, first time only)</li>
            <li>Broker redirects back with an authorization code</li>
            <li>Your app exchanges the code at <code>/token</code> for an <code>id_token</code></li>
            <li>The token's <code>sub</code> claim is a pairwise ID unique to your origin</li>
          </ol>
          <p>
            Sessions last 14 days. The SDK handles PKCE, session monitoring, and token
            storage automatically.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Server Verification -->
        <section class="doc-section" id="server-verification">
          <h2 class="doc-heading">Server Verification</h2>
          <p>
            To verify tokens server-side, fetch the public keys from the JWKS endpoint
            and validate the <code>id_token</code> signature:
          </p>
          <pre class="doc-code"><code>// Fetch JWKS
GET https://auth.adityavs.tech/.well-known/jwks.json

// Verify id_token
// - Algorithm: ES256
// - Issuer: https://auth.adityavs.tech
// - Audience: origin:https://yourapp.com</code></pre>
        </section>

        <!-- Convex -->
        <section class="doc-section" id="convex">
          <h2 class="doc-heading">Convex Integration</h2>
          <p>
            AVS AUTH works seamlessly with Convex. Use the React hook to get the
            identity, then pass the <code>id_token</code> to your Convex functions
            for server-side verification.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- API Reference -->
        <section class="doc-section" id="api-reference">
          <h2 class="doc-heading">API Reference</h2>

          <h3 class="doc-subheading">createAvsAuth(options)</h3>
          <p>Creates a new auth client instance.</p>
          <div class="doc-table-wrap">
            <table class="doc-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>Option</th>
                  <th>Type</th>
                  <th>Description</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td><code>avsBaseUrl</code></td>
                  <td><code>string</code></td>
                  <td>Broker URL (https://auth.adityavs.tech)</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><code>callbackPath</code></td>
                  <td><code>string</code></td>
                  <td>Path on your app for the OAuth callback</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <h3 class="doc-subheading">Auth Methods</h3>
          <div class="doc-table-wrap">
            <table class="doc-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>Method</th>
                  <th>Returns</th>
                  <th>Description</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td><code>startSignIn()</code></td>
                  <td><code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code></td>
                  <td>Initiates PKCE sign-in redirect</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><code>handleCallback()</code></td>
                  <td><code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code></td>
                  <td>Exchanges code for token on callback page</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><code>getIdentity()</code></td>
                  <td><code>Identity | null</code></td>
                  <td>Returns current identity or null</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><code>checkSession()</code></td>
                  <td><code>Promise&lt;SessionStatus&gt;</code></td>
                  <td>Checks session status with broker</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><code>logout()</code></td>
                  <td><code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code></td>
                  <td>Revokes session and clears local state</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .docs-page {
    padding-top: 40px;
    padding-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .docs-header {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--yellow);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .docs-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .docs-subtitle {
    font-size: 1rem;
    opacity: 0.5;
    max-width: 500px;
  }

  .docs-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  /* Sidebar */
  .docs-sidebar {
    position: sticky;
    top: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .sidebar-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--yellow);
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .sidebar-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .sidebar-link {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--white);
    opacity: 0.5;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 4px 0;
    display: block;
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }

  .sidebar-link:hover {
    opacity: 1;
    color: var(--yellow);
    padding-left: 8px;
  }

  /* Content */
  .docs-content {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .doc-section {
    padding-bottom: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .doc-section:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .doc-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .doc-subheading {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 24px 0 12px;
    color: var(--yellow);
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .doc-section p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    opacity: 0.65;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .doc-section code {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    background: rgba(235, 255, 0, 0.08);
    color: var(--yellow);
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .doc-section strong {
    color: var(--white);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .doc-code {
    background: rgba(245, 245, 245, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    overflow-x: auto;
    color: var(--yellow);
    margin: 12px 0;
  }

  .doc-code code {
    background: none;
    padding: 0;
    color: var(--yellow);
  }

  .doc-list {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin: 12px 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .doc-list li {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    opacity: 0.6;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .doc-list li code {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .doc-table-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin: 12px 0;
  }

  .doc-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .doc-table th {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: left;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    background: rgba(235, 255, 0, 0.04);
    color: var(--yellow);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .doc-table td {
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .doc-table td code {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  .doc-table tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .doc-table tr:hover td {
    background: rgba(235, 255, 0, 0.02);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .docs-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .docs-sidebar {
      position: static;
      flex-direction: row;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
      padding-bottom: 24px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
  }
</style>
